<blockquote>A Poem. C. 2770</blockquote>
<blockquote>Long may there be peace.</blockquote>
<blockquote>I wonder what else there is.</blockquote>
<blockquote>Not since the Bandini,</blockquote>
<blockquote>deep in the past,</blockquote>
<blockquote>have we gone wanting.</blockquote>
<blockquote>We have it all.</blockquote>
<blockquote>It makes me wonder if we need to defend it?</blockquote>
<blockquote>Long may there be peace.</blockquote>
